### KYC Platform: manual walkthrough (Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code REST Client)
### Run top to bottom. Image uploads go to pre-signed URLs, so they're easier with scripts/demo.ps1.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@partnerKey = dev-partner-key
@reviewerId = staff-1042

### 1. Partner creates a session (try sending it twice: same Idempotency-Key returns the same session)
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/verification-sessions
X-Api-Key: {{partnerKey}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantReference": "customer-42",
  "channel": "Web",
  "customer": { "ipAddress": "198.51.100.7", "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0 Desktop", "deviceFingerprint": "fp-desktop" }
}

###
@sessionId = {{create.response.body.$.sessionId}}
@desktopToken = {{create.response.body.$.clientToken}}

### 2. Desktop: current state / next action
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/client/session
Authorization: Bearer {{desktopToken}}

### 3. Desktop: create the QR handoff (token is in the URL fragment after #token=)
# @name handoff
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/client/session/handoff
Authorization: Bearer {{desktopToken}}

### 4. Phone: redeem the QR token (paste the value after #token=)
# @name redeem
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/handoff/redeem
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone) Mobile

{ "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_HANDOFF_URL", "deviceFingerprint": "fp-phone" }

###
@phoneToken = {{redeem.response.body.$.clientToken}}

### 5. Phone: request an upload slot (then PUT the file to uploadUrl with Content-Type: image/jpeg)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/client/session/artifacts
Authorization: Bearer {{phoneToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "IdentityDocument", "contentType": "image/jpeg", "sizeBytes": 12345, "sha256": "<sha256 of the file>" }

### 6. Partner: full session view (checks, decisions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/verification-sessions/{{sessionId}}
X-Api-Key: {{partnerKey}}

### 7. Partner: audit trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/verification-sessions/{{sessionId}}/events
X-Api-Key: {{partnerKey}}

### 8. Reviewer (via the partner's back office): manual review queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reviews
X-Api-Key: {{partnerKey}}
X-Reviewer-Id: {{reviewerId}}

### 9. Reviewer: open a case (identity, short-lived image links, related sessions; the access is audited)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reviews/{{sessionId}}
X-Api-Key: {{partnerKey}}
X-Reviewer-Id: {{reviewerId}}

### 10. Reviewer: decide
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/reviews/{{sessionId}}/decision
X-Api-Key: {{partnerKey}}
X-Reviewer-Id: {{reviewerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "Approved", "reasonCode": "VERIFIED_MANUALLY", "notes": "Document and selfie checked" }

### Ops
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
